  3→ *
  4→ * Usage:
  5→ *   npx tsx scripts/backfill-search.ts [options]
  6→ *
  7→ * Options:
  8→ *   --repo <full_name>     Only backfill a specific repo (e.g., "entireio/cli")
  9→ *   --with-transcripts     Fetch transcript excerpts from GitHub (slower, needs GITHUB_TOKEN)
 10→ *   --dry-run              Show what would be indexed without writing to Turbopuffer
 11→ *   --limit <n>            Max checkpoints per repo (for testing)
 12→ *
 13→ * Environment:
 14→ *   DATABASE_URL           MySQL connection string (defaults to local Docker MySQL)
 15→ *   TURBOPUFFER_API_KEY    Turbopuffer API key (required unless --dry-run)
 16→ *   OPENAI_API_KEY         OpenAI API key for embeddings (required unless --dry-run)
 17→ *   GITHUB_TOKEN           GitHub PAT with repo read access (required for --with-transcripts)
 18→ */
